        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Daltoni, Dalton Gang\n- Places: Niš, Serbia, former Yugoslavia, American Old West\n- Topics: rock music, outlaw groups\n\nFacts:\n- Dalton Gang was a group of outlaws in the American Old West during 1890 to 1892.\n- Daltoni was a Serbian and formerly Yugoslav rock band from Niš.\n- Daltoni is written in Serbian Cyrillic as Далтони and translates as \"The Daltons.\"\n- Daltoni was notable as one of the pioneers of the former Yugoslav rock scene.",
